From fcd8bc8b86436ddf6ef1f611c7ed298107d0bd8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StegVerse <210078727+StegVerse@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:41:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fetch the public StegCore at the pin in every decision run

StegCore is now public (owner decision relayed on StegVerse-org/StegVerse-SDK#465),
which supersedes the TV/TVC private-source-read route: a GitHub-hosted run reads
the pinned commit with no credential at all.

- authority-fetch: anonymous fetch of exactly the pinned commit into a new
  directory, detached checkout, HEAD must be the pin (evidence authority_fetch.json)
- the workflow fetches and installs StegCore unconditionally before the cycle;
  a failed fetch or install fails the run before any request is decided, so no
  request is answered FAIL_CLOSED for want of StegCore
- the decision_authority_source/receipt inputs, the TV/TVC receipt check and
  the not-installed step are removed; the pin records the public, anonymous read

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DDXUuBBSUMvA4z87YhFjvX
